with EXT002, import reload vs preview-only no-reopen, render request shape + artifact adoption + lease accounting, render failure surfacing, render cancellation (async gated fake, no deadlock), stable-key selection incl. separate-document clips, reset, cancel-command token propagation, double dispose. WI-C5-11 flipped to Ready. Validation: 14/14, full non-interactive suites green, build/format/brace clean.
