ighted vertex, shared-bone conflict); SkinnedModelBytes fixture weights all four vertices and the old rejection test became SkinnedShapeImportsAsSkinnedMeshOnRootBone; NifTestDataBuilder.SkinData gained boneTranslations. Validation: 17/17 NifSkinConverterTests, 158/158 non-interactive Nif filter, 1527+324+53 non-interactive suite green (same 7 environmental real-install failures excluded as card 04), format + brace check clean.
