es param + GetBoneFromModel). Validation: build clean; NifAnimationImporterTests 58/58; Ee2NifPropertyAnimationTests+Ee2KfAnimationImportTests 20/20 interactive; full non-interactive gate with environmental exclusions 1620+328+53 passed; dotnet format and brace check clean. WI-C4f-04 flipped to Ready.
